# Svelte 5 Best Practices (febriannugroho)

Load `.agents/skills/svelte-core-bestpractices/SKILL.md` for full guidance. Key invariants:

## Reactivity

- Use `$state` only for values that drive UI updates; prefer `$state.raw` for large reassigned objects (e.g. API responses)
- Prefer `$derived` over `$effect` for computed values
- Avoid updating state inside `$effect` — use event handlers, `{@attach}`, or `$derived` instead

## Components

- Use `$props()` — never `export let`
- Use `onclick={...}` — never `on:click`
- Use `{#snippet}` / `{@render}` — never `<slot>`
- Use keyed `{#each}` blocks with stable unique keys (not index)
- Use `createContext` for shared state (SSR-safe)

## Validation

Before finishing any Svelte edit:

1. Run Svelte MCP `svelte-autofixer` on changed files
2. Run `bun run -F web check` from repo root

## Project paths

- Components: `apps/web/src/components/`
- Routes: `apps/web/src/routes/`
- oRPC client: `apps/web/src/lib/orpc.ts`
